      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRACTOR SAM (7) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 10 lengths sixth (23.28) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 400m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Has the ability and looks a key chance. MOTOR CITY TIG (4) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 8th at Gunnedah following on from a third place finish (23.76) at Dubbo the start prior. One of the better hopes. RAZOR'S SHINE (8) should enjoy clear running from the outside box. Below best latest at Gunnedah (20.83) when 8th and beaten 17 lengths. Has a strong winning record here at this journey including zero wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. TRAIN TICKET (1) cannot be dismissed although new to this venue.",
